OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA risk of some early rain over
OL,6,FBuchan. Otherwise a bright day with
OL,7,Fsome sunny spells in the morning then
OL,8,Fshowers developing in the afternoon,
OL,9,Fmainly for North Aberdeenshire.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny showers tending to die
OL,12,Fout through the evening and although
OL,13,Fcloudy at first, clear spells
OL,14,Fdeveloping later with light westerly
OL,15,Fwinds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CWednesday:FA bright start on Wednesday
OL,18,Fbut some light rain or showers
OL,19,Fdeveloping in the afternoon, a few
OL,20,Fshowers turning heavy and slow moving
OL,21,Fin the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
