OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FFresher conditions in northerly winds
OL,7,Fwith scattered showers at times on
OL,8,FThursday, a lot of brighter and sunny
OL,9,Fweather particularly towards the
OL,10,Fweekend.
